+# Sweet pink and result-first content audit
+
+The user authorized direct frontend changes and publication: remove the purple-gradient pink appearance, simplify the full-site content audit, and place a prominent 「重新健檢」 action at the top.
+
+## Acceptance
+- Solid cherry-blossom pink header and blush/white surfaces, legible foregrounds, no purple gradient in pink theme rules. Original theme, four accent/mode choices, golden sales graph and semantic evidence colors remain.
+- Content audit opens on results, not giant Excel workflow panels. Export/import are independent explicit toggles; state stays mounted. Both original export scopes remain. Original-machine/account/site, 24-hour source expiry and partial-sheet instructions remain visible when relevant.
+- Top 「重新健檢」 uses the existing single-flight job starter; it is disabled while exporting or batch preview/commit is busy. No extra API requests from display controls.
+- Eight compact filter controls include 「全部待確認」, whose count is attention rows, NOT all products. The seven existing category semantics are unchanged. Search/count/view share a toolbar; technical details follow the results in a disclosure.
+- No main/preload/transport/source TTL/approval/ledger/package version/dependency/installer changes; no real account activity. Preserve concurrent repository work.
+
+## Verification
+Existing content safety and stylesheet contracts plus new mounted file/toggle/busy tests; pink-gradient and foreground contrast samples. Production browser checks cover four appearances at desktop/mobile, actual tool visibility, file persistence, busy guards and exactly one explicit recheck. Broader nine-audit and homepage regression checks remain mandatory before publication.
